  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Multiannual Operational Programme on Digital Economy and Society in favour of Republic of Albania for 2024 - 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Operational Programme Digital Economy and Society aims to advance the country&#xbf;s efforts to further proceed with the digitalisation process in three out of the above four pillars, and in parallel will support sectoral reforms and alignment of national legislation with the EU acquis. &#xbf;The Operational Programme is consistent with the main EU policies on the Digital Agenda, the Digital Agenda for the Western Balkans and the Window 3 objectives and priorities[1] of the IPA III Programming Framework. This Operational Programme consists of two sectoral Areas of Support and one Area of Support (Other Support) focused on support to Programme management and control, and communication and awareness raising. [1]Green Agenda and Sustainable Connectivity, Thematic Priority: Transport, Digital Economy and Society, and Energy.</narrative>
  </description>
